      "message": "fix(2d): say in a note when the uncut-corner check did not run\n\nThe error arm of the corner check in `keep_law::narrow_noted` wrote only\na log line. The band check above it adds a note in the same case. The\ncorner check now adds its own note, so the user sees that the check did\nnot run. The path is kept and the cut is not blocked.\n\nPinned by operation::keep_law::tests::a_corner_check_that_cannot_run_says_so_in_a_note.\n\nFixes #2511\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
